      "extension": ".md",
      "mime_type": "text/markdown",
      "content": "# Aurora Cache Design\nAurora is a local document cache. Each cache entry expires after fifteen minutes. A successful write must invalidate the matching key. The cache uses an LRU eviction policy and a 256 MiB storage budget.",
